# Sessions Overview = day truth you look at

Victor's day-to-day surface is **Sessions Overview** (admin Sessions hub → overview day board). Same role LOCAL had as the board he watches.

## How to change the day

| Where | What it writes | Overview sees it via |
|-------|----------------|----------------------|
| **Schedule & Covers** | `schedule_overrides` (+ MADRE fold) | Hub expand + override paint |
| **Validate day** | `staff_unavailability` + COVER NEEDED overrides | Same |
| **Finish booking / trial paid** | dated `portal_roster_rows` + trial override + MADRE fold | Same |
| **Edit term slot** | `portal_roster_rows` (rest of term) | Roster refresh |
| **Cursor / machine** | `portal_roster_canonical.js` and/or LOCAL port | Deploy + refresh |

After portal day writes, call **`portalSyncOverviewDayTruth`** (admin dashboard) so MADRE / roster / override caches and the Overview board stay current.

## LOCAL vs Overview

- **LOCAL** (`local_dc_staff_week.html`) = Autumn **authoring** for standing / week-1 / dated EXTRA before overrides. Still commit+push when it changes; port into `portal_roster_canonical.js`.
- **Overview** = **runtime look-here** board (canonical + MADRE + `portal_roster_rows` + `schedule_overrides`).
- Do **not** make Overview read LOCAL HTML in the browser.
- Prefer day exceptions via Schedule & Covers (overrides) instead of new one-off hardcodes in canonical for every cover.

## Agent habits

1. When Victor says something is wrong on the day board, check **Overview** first, then Schedule & Covers / overrides / dated roster rows — not a second parallel truth.
2. After implementing Schedule / Validate / booking day writes, ensure Overview refresh is wired (do not leave caches stale).
3. Keep alerts paused until Victor asks to reactivate (see `reactivate-alerts-after-rota.mdc`).
